sequenceDiagram
    actor Patient
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Patient->>API: POST /consultations + Idempotency-Key
    API->>API: Authenticate, authorize, validate, hash request
    API->>DB: Begin transaction / serialize idempotency key
    API->>DB: Lock availability slot FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>API: Current slot state
    API->>API: Check availability and verified doctor
    API->>DB: Insert consultation + idempotency result + audit event
    API->>DB: Mark slot BOOKED
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>Patient: 201 Created
    Note over API,DB: Duplicate request replays stored response; key with changed payload returns 409
